            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"rag-tutor-notebook-4-capstone-final-project-studio\">\ud83c\udf93 RAG Tutor \u2014 Notebook 4: Capstone Final Project Studio</h1>\n<h3 id=\"bring-your-own-documents-compare-basic-vs-production-rag-side-by-side\"><em>Bring Your Own Documents &amp; Compare Basic vs. Production RAG Side-by-Side</em></h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Congratulations on reaching the <strong>Final Project</strong>! Here you can edit or paste your own custom\nMarkdown knowledge base, configure every stage of your DuckDB + <code>Llama.app</code> RAG pipeline, and\nvisually compare <strong>Pipeline A (Basic 50-Line Scratch RAG)</strong> against <strong>Pipeline B (Production RAG)</strong> in real time.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Backend</strong>: \ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Llama.app Connected</strong> \u2014 <em>Connected to Llama.app at <a href=\"http://localhost:9931\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:9931</a> (1 model(s) found)</em></span>\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-0' random-id='f19f87f2-1d08-c84f-a639-24d392619ac8'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;ggml-org/gemma-4-E4B-it-GGUF:Q8_0&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eLlama.app Model:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;ggml-org/gemma-4-E4B-it-GGUF:Q8_0&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='MJUe-1' random-id='07988e0c-c28a-2bd1-68e3-4faa6e82766c'><marimo-switch data-initial-value='false' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eEnable Thinking&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-disabled='false'></marimo-switch></marimo-ui-element></div>\n\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"1-knowledge-base-editor-50-total-chunks-indexed-in-duckdb\">1. Knowledge Base Editor (<code>50</code> Total Chunks Indexed in DuckDB)</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-0' random-id='066c6e94-89cb-86d6-2030-e453baa0208f'><marimo-text-area data-initial-value='&quot;# Project Apollo Internal Runbook&#92;n&#92;n## 1. Service Architecture &amp; Port Binding&#92;nThe Apollo Inference Gateway runs locally on macOS port <code>9931</code> via <code>Llama.app</code> and stores vector embeddings inside <code>apollo_vectors.duckdb</code> using 128-dimensional <code>FLOAT[128]</code> arrays.&#92;n&#92;n## 2. Incident Recovery Code <code>INC-APOLLO-99</code>&#92;nIf retrieval latency exceeds 120ms during peak traffic, engineers must follow runbook code <code>INC-APOLLO-99</code>: reduce Stage-1 candidate pool from 50 to 15 and enable Cross-Encoder reranking (<code>STAGE2-RERANK-15to3</code>) with Top-3 cutoff.&#92;n&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eBring Your Own Markdown Document (added live to the DuckDB knowledge base):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='8'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element></span>\n<h2 id=\"2-production-pipeline-controls\">2. Production Pipeline Controls</h2>\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-1' random-id='390354a5-a93c-35cb-a81a-0e3f35c64697'><marimo-dropdown data-initial-value='[&quot;Markdown Section-Aware&quot;]' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eChunking Strategy:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Markdown Section-Aware&quot;,&quot;Fixed-Character Window&quot;]' data-allow-select-none='false' data-searchable='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-dropdown></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-2' random-id='bc020fa9-aa66-40e3-2628-35b519bef976'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='0.5' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eHybrid \u03b1 (BM25 \u2194 Vector):&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0.0' data-stop='1.0' data-step='0.1' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-5' random-id='69a7fa77-7d65-e672-5eb5-e9c57b828bb5'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='3' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eFinal Top K Context Chunks:&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='1' data-stop='5' data-step='1' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='false' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element></div>\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 3rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-3' random-id='33dc527c-0833-d6bb-64d6-b6f69b7ff266'><marimo-switch data-initial-value='true' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eCross-Encoder Reranker&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-disabled='false'></marimo-switch></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-4' random-id='a788f338-4ddc-692f-47ef-a3fb489f894a'><marimo-switch data-initial-value='true' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eAgentic Multi-Hop &amp;amp; Verification&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-disabled='false'></marimo-switch></marimo-ui-element></div>\n\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;50 Chunks&quot;' data-label='&quot;DuckDB Knowledge Base&quot;' data-caption='&quot;47 core + 3 custom chunks&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;cos = 0.686&quot;' data-label='&quot;Pipeline A Peak Score&quot;' data-caption='&quot;Pure-Python Scratch Vector RAG&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-stat data-value='&quot;score = 0.941&quot;' data-label='&quot;Pipeline B Peak Score&quot;' data-caption='&quot;Sub-queries: 2 \u00b7 Faithfulness: 100%&quot;' data-bordered='true' data-target_direction='&quot;increase&quot;'></marimo-stat></div></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"3-ab-pipeline-arena\">3. A/B Pipeline Arena</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-6' random-id='29393b7d-1f0c-2f63-26ff-3eba74da9ab