px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"width:48.0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#14b8a6,#2dd4bf);height:100%;border-radius:4px;\"></div></div></div> </div> </div> <div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 2rem'><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003e\ud83d\udcd8 Pipeline A: Basic 50-Line Scratch RAG&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cem&#92;u003eStorage:&#92;u003c/em&#92;u003e Python &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003elist&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e \u00b7 &#92;u003cem&#92;u003eRetrieval:&#92;u003c/em&#92;u003e Pure Cosine Similarity&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eIf retrieval latency exceeds 120ms during peak traffic, engineers must follow runbook code &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eINC-APOLLO-99&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e. This involves reducing the Stage-1 candidate pool from 50 to 15 and enabling Cross-Encoder reranking using &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eSTAGE2-RERANK-15to3&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e with a Top-3 cutoff.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;info&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003e\ud83d\ude80 Pipeline B: Production RAG (Sub-queries: 2 \u00b7 Faithfulness: 100%)&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cem&#92;u003eStorage:&#92;u003c/em&#92;u003e Embedded DuckDB (&#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eFLOAT[128]&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e + BM25)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eIf retrieval latency surpasses 120ms during peak traffic, engineers must follow runbook code &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eINC-APOLLO-99&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e [Chunk #50]. This involves reducing the Stage-1 candidate pool from 50 to 15 and enabling Cross-Encoder reranking using &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eSTAGE2-RERANK-15to3&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e with a Top-3 cutoff [Chunk #50].&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div></div></div></div><div data-kind='tab'><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Toggle the switches above to watch the active production pipeline rewire live:</span></span><marimo-mermaid data-diagram='&quot;flowchart LR&#92;n    Docs[&#92;&quot;Corpus + Custom Doc&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e Chunker[&#92;&quot;Markdown Section Chunker&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    Chunker --&#92;u003e DB[(&#92;&quot;DuckDB Store (50 Chunks)&#92;&quot;)]&#92;n    Q[&#92;&quot;User Question&#92;&quot;] --&#92;u003e Plan{{&#92;&quot;Agentic Multi-Hop Planner&#92;&quot;}}&#92;n    Plan --&#92;u003e Hybrid[&#92;&quot;Hybrid RRF (\u03b1=0.5 Vec / 0.5 BM25)&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    DB --&#92;u003e Hybrid&#92;n    Hybrid --&#92;u003e Rerank[&#92;&quot;Stage-2 Cross-Encoder (Top-3)&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    Rerank --&#92;u003e LLM[&#92;&quot;Llama.app Synthesis&#92;&quot;]&#92;n    LLM --&#92;u003e Verify[&#92;&quot;Faithfulness Audit &amp; Citations&#92;&quot;]&quot;'></marimo-mermaid></div></div><div data-kind='tab'><div style=\"background:#0f172a;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #334155;color:#f8fafc;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content: